From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tristin Baker <tristinbaker@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:56:51 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add an SDL2 platform backend, selected with OE_USE_SDL2

src/Library/Platform/Sdl2 implements the platform interface against SDL 2.30 for platforms that only
have SDL2, such as the PS5 homebrew SDK. It is a port of the SDL3 backend, which stays the default and is
unchanged. ImGui uses its SDL2 backend in that configuration. Adaptive vsync falls back to normal vsync
when the driver rejects it.
